            "review_text": "Zuzanna\nWarsaw, Poland8 contributions\n1\nAvoid avoid avoid, they hit women customers!\nJan 2020 • Friends\nLooks pretty and bright from outside but that where it looks best. Look for other, more friendly places. The staff is EXTREMELY rude, once you enter they shove menus in your face demendaing that you order something right there . They dont allow you in parts of the bar withoutbuyung something. As I was with a group of friends I finally ordered a beer. The menu was all.covered in stickers but I clearly saw 59k so asked for one Tiger. Later waiter comes to me with a bill for 119k, I show him the menu and the 59k (all my friends saw it too). He even more aggressively gets menus from other servers where it is 119k but not in his which he showed me. I'd his attitude was different I would pay but he got more and more agressive and at one point he actually hit me in the arm. After that we just left and I refused the beer. This city has so many good and friendly.options, dont waste your time there.\nRead more\nWritten January 29, 2020",
